{"ticker":"GEHC","updated":"2026-10-23T23:01:29Z","profile":{"longName":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc.","shortName":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gehealthcare.com","fullTimeEmployees":54000,"marketCap":32272979968,"trailingPE":16.425287,"forwardPE":13.200582,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5175859,"pegRatio":1.78,"targetMeanPrice":82.7,"targetHighPrice":96.0,"targetLowPrice":70.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.058,"earningsGrowth":0.168,"grossMargins":0.39528,"operatingMargins":0.14976,"profitMargins":0.093339995,"totalRevenue":21265999872,"beta":0.848,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":89.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":58.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.22},"summary":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. engages in the development, manufacture, and marketing of products, services, and complementary digital solutions used in the diagnosis, treatment, and monitoring of patients in the United States, Canada, and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Imaging, Advanced Visualization Solutions (AVS), Patient Care Solutions (PCS), and Pharmaceutical Diagnostics (PDx). The Imaging segment offers molecular imaging, computed tomography (CT) scanning, magnetic resonance (MR) imaging, X-ray systems, and women's health products. The AVS segment provides ultrasound, image guided therapies, and interventional solutions for screening, diagnosis, treatment, and monitoring of certain diseases in clinical areas, such as women's health, cardiovascular, and comprehensive care ultrasound as well as surgical visualization and guidance products. The PCS segment provides medical devices, consumables, services, and digital solutions. Its portfolio includes patient monitoring, diagnostic cardiology, consumables and services, digital solutions, maternal infant care, and anesthesia products. The PDx segment supplies diagnostic agents, including CT, angiography and X-ray, MR, single-photon emission computed tomography, and positron emission tomography to the radiology and nuclear medicine industries. The segment also provides contrast media pharmaceutic","summary_zh":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. 從事產品、服務和補充數位解決方案的開發、製造和行銷，這些解決方案用於美國、加拿大和國際上患者的診斷、治療和監測。該公司透過四個部門運作：影像部門、高級視覺化解決方案部門 (AVS)、病患照護解決方案部門 (PCS) 和藥物診斷部門 (PDx)。影像部門提供分子影像、電腦斷層掃描 (CT) 掃描、磁振造影 (MR) 影像、X 光系統和女性健康產品。 AVS部門提供超音波、影像導引治療和介入解決方案，用於臨床領域某些疾病的篩檢、診斷、治療和監測，例如女性健康、心血管和綜合護理超音波以及手術視覺化和引導產品。 PCS 部門提供醫療設備、消耗品、服務和數位解決方案。其產品組合包括病患監護、心臟病診斷、消耗品和服務、數​​位解決方案、母嬰護理和麻醉產品。 PDx 部門為放射學和核子醫學產業提供診斷試劑，包括 CT、血管攝影和 X 光、MR、單光子發射電腦斷層掃描和正子斷層掃描。該部門也提供造影劑藥品","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":74.97,"h":75.11,"l":73.998,"c":74.59,"v":2022000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":74.58,"h":74.909,"l":73.76,"c":74.09,"v":1845900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":73.77,"h":74.48,"l":73.72,"c":74.26,"v":2113000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":74.425,"h":74.5,"l":73.22,"c":73.72,"v":2511900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":73.68,"h":74.15,"l":73.2,"c":73.73,"v":1983000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.97,"h":73.31,"l":71.14,"c":71.6,"v":4045600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":71.915,"h":72.66,"l":71.63,"c":72.38,"v":3882900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":72.48,"h":74.14,"l":71.56,"c":74.12,"v":2217100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":74.25,"h":75.75,"l":74.21,"c":75.73,"v":3010700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":76.14,"h":78.43,"l":74.99,"c":78.16,"v":6251200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":77.94,"h":78.89,"l":77.41,"c":78.71,"v":3997900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":78.71,"h":79.69,"l":75.65,"c":75.99,"v":4250400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":75.94,"h":78.4,"l":75.64,"c":77.96,"v":4358000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":77.47,"h":77.635,"l":76.38,"c":76.44,"v":3254100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":76.58,"h":78.24,"l":76.5,"c":77.76,"v":3196700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":78.32,"h":78.5,"l":77.31,"c":77.48,"v":3384400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":77.5,"h":78.68,"l":76.11,"c":76.63,"v":2925300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.99,"h":77.05,"l":73.75,"